Root cause:
The bug arises from the failure to reset the receive buffer size (`rx.len`) after consecutive command transmissions that may return variable-sized responses. This oversight can lead to incorrect interpretation of response sizes, as the buffer retains the size set by the previous response, potentially causing the system to read only a portion of a larger response from the firmware.

